Template: tt-local-generator/hf-token
Type: password
Default:
Description: HuggingFace access token (optional for Z-Image-Turbo)
 Z-Image-Turbo (Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo) is a publicly available model.
 A HuggingFace account is not required, though providing a token helps
 avoid API rate limits for large downloads.
 .
 You can re-run the download later with:
   tt-local-gen-download-model --repo Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo
 .
 Your token is used once and immediately discarded — it is not stored.
